# AI Tools Catalog - Amatriz Typora Theme

This file is a living directory of all scripts, utilities, and helper tools created by coding AIs in the ai_tools/ folder. Each entry documents what the tool does, its inputs/outputs, and usage instructions so that subsequent AI sessions do not recreate existing tools.

